# Mycosynth Lattice's "players may spend mana as though it were mana of any color" is read as the mana is spent (CR 609.4b,
# 611.3a), after the cast's chance to activate mana abilities (CR 601.2g-h). Bot1 casts Lightning Bolt with the Lattice out
# and, in the cast's mana window, has Krark-Clan Ironworks sacrifice the Lattice for {C}{C}: the Lattice is gone when the cost
# is paid, so the {C}{C} can't pay the {R} and the window stays open - with the Lattice still applying it would have closed by
# itself, the pool covering the cost. Mox Ruby's {R} pays it, and the {C}{C} is left in the pool.
# Turn 1: Island, Mox Ruby, and two Black Lotuses for the Lattice. Turn 3: a Lotus and the Island for the Ironworks.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Mycosynth Lattice
Krark-Clan Ironworks
Lightning Bolt
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x24

